WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.022
Three roles, three different jobs.

2
00:00:04.022 --> 00:00:08.100
People mix them up all the time.

3
00:00:08.350 --> 00:00:12.515
An executor handles your estate after you die.

4
00:00:12.515 --> 00:00:14.355
They file the will,

5
00:00:14.355 --> 00:00:18.600
pay debts, and distribute what's left.

6
00:00:18.850 --> 00:00:22.542
A trustee manages what's inside a trust,

7
00:00:22.542 --> 00:00:25.283
for you while you are alive,

8
00:00:25.283 --> 00:00:29.100
and for your beneficiaries later.

9
00:00:29.350 --> 00:00:33.808
A power of attorney lets an agent act for you while

10
00:00:33.808 --> 00:00:38.089
you're alive, usually for money and property.

11
00:00:38.089 --> 00:00:40.600
It ends at death.

12
00:00:40.850 --> 00:00:45.170
A separate health care directive names who speaks

13
00:00:45.170 --> 00:00:48.600
for you on medical choices.

14
00:00:48.850 --> 00:00:52.767
Choose people who are honest and organized,

15
00:00:52.767 --> 00:00:54.670
and name backups.

16
00:00:54.670 --> 00:00:57.100
Our guide helps.
